55:08.320 --> 55:08.560
Anything.

55:08.880 --> 55:20.440
The QWERTY trained hand is quite literally a biological arc that carries the latent capacity to interface with almost any symbolic system human beings can invent, provided we simply supply the right digital translation layer.

55:20.440 --> 55:25.120
Muscle memory, properly harnessed, is the ultimate universal translator.

55:26.040 --> 55:28.140
