55:46.060 --> 55:49.240
We are not mere operators pushing mechanical levers on a machine.

55:49.240 --> 55:54.680
We are utilizing a highly compressed, biologically native generative engine.

55:55.180 --> 56:00.740
The keyboard is merely a temporary prosthesis designed to capture the output of that engine.

