All the same principle.

56:21.540 --> 56:28.660
That physical geometry, that highly specific dance that lives inside your nervous system and your muscles, is an arc.

56:29.300 --> 56:34.440
It is a dense, incredibly valuable, highly compressed library of motor phonology.

56:35.000 --> 56:42.440
You could theoretically use that exact same physical dance to learn to operate a drone or speak a synthetic language or edit a film.

56:42.440 --> 56:46.760
